PENDING\r\n[INFO]  Poll 2 of 6...\r\n[INFO]  Image ready! URL: https://cdn.leonardo.ai/users/4e6cdfb9-e008-469b-9c7c-35a85ae2b9cb/generations/c238b6d0-1118-409f-b4e7-1e2883cf0646/Leonardo_Vision_XL_Medium_shot_of_a_US_lawmaker_signing_a_bill_0.jpg\r\n[INFO]  Downloading to /tmp/crypto-run-20260522-083045/media/feature.jpg (via /tmp/leonardo-dl-c238b6d0-1118-409f-b4e7-1e2883cf0646.jpg)...\r\n[INFO]  Downloaded 1035784 bytes.\r\n[INFO]  Stamping logo...\r\n[INFO]  Logo stamped.\r\n[INFO]  Final image at /tmp/crypto-run-20260522-083045/media/feature.jpg — 1031412 bytes\r\nSUCCESS: /tmp/crypto-run-20260522-083045/media/feature.jpg\r\n","name":"bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-...rate-image/generate.sh"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779439232744}}
